WEBVTT

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.920
The Scholar and the Emperor

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:40.360
A face as flawless as jade.

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:41.600
Such delicate features.

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:43.600
Tall and graceful.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:45.280
Dashing and handsome.

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:46.520
Suave and debonair.

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:47.600
A commanding presence.

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:49.680
When has Shazhou ever seen

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:51.360
A man this handsome?

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:53.120
Look how he eats that lamb.

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:54.120
So elegant.

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:55.720
He must be from Jiangnan.

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:57.640
He's like a refined young lord

00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:59.000
Who stepped out of a painting.

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:01.880
Even gnawing on a lamb bone looks refined.

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:03.560
A handsome man

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:05.000
Makes anything look good.

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:06.720
I'll invite him for a drink.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:07.640
I will.

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:08.720
I will.

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:09.840
I will.

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.320
I will.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:12.760
-I will. -I will.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:22.960
Bring him my finest

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:23.920
Grape wine.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.040
Young Master, please.

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:33.680
Ladies, after you.

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:36.200
Come back.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:42.680
No need to see me out.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:47.640
Manager Yan.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.800
I was blind to side with Jiang Mei'er.

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:53.760
Please ask your father not to cut off my family's business.

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:54.840
My father said

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:56.520
If I can't win your family's business back,

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:57.880
He'll break my legs.

00:02:57.960 --> 00:02:58.800
You're magnanimous.

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:00.200
Please forgive me this once.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.480
Too late.

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:02.840
When you sided with Jiang Mei'er,

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:04.600
You should've expected this.

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:06.280
I was wrong.

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:07.520
I failed to recognize your worth.

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:08.640
You can't just leave me to die.

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:09.680
Get out.

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:11.680
Don't disrupt my business.

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:15.040
Yan Fuzhi!

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:16.360
Are you really trying to ruin me?

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.040
Jiang Mei'er was right.

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:19.920
You're a venomous shrew too,

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.040
Just like Meng Tinghui.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:22.880
You're both heartless wolves.

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:26.320
How dare you insult Mengmeng!

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:28.160
Today I'll show you

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.680
What "venomous" really means,

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:31.200
And what a heartless wolf can do.

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:33.720
Get up.

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:38.880
Help!

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:43.800
Set foot in Bofeng House again,

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:45.240
And I'll kick your backside raw.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.160
Eat.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.120
Such a pretty girl,

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:02.000
Yet so fierce and unruly.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:03.320
Even when disciplining your husband,

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:04.880
You should know when to stop, shouldn't you?

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:07.200
Who says he's my husband? He's not worthy.

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.960
What a waste of a handsome face.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:10.040
Turns out you're a fool

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:11.560
Who starts preening at the sight of a woman.

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:15.080
That cuts deep, miss.

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:17.960
I was only trying to stop the fight.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:19.600
But with a temper that fiery,

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:21.520
No wonder that gentleman would rather be beaten

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:22.680
Than marry you.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:23.920
You...

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:25.360
You're leaving too.

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:26.280
Whether I marry or not

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:28.160
Is none of your concern, you lecher

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.400
Who spouts nothing but love poems.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.160
What right do you have to throw me out?

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:35.600
I'm the manager of Bofeng House.

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:38.720
Out. Now.

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:42.200
Get out!

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:45.480
You...

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.000
Out!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.200
You really are fierce and unreasonable.

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:52.640
You're never setting foot in Bofeng House again either.

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:54.920
Why can't I...

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:57.200
Old Huang?

00:04:57.280 --> 00:04:58.120
What are you doing here?

00:04:58.200 --> 00:04:59.240
His Lordship sent me to find you.

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:00.200
Wait here.

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:01.360
I need to settle this with her.

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:02.880
She hit me with an abacus!

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:04.480
Lord Shen,

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.600
You really can't afford to cross her.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.120
She's just an innkeeper.

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.240
What's so formidable about her?

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:12.280
She's Meng Tinghui's best friend.

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:15.400
She once chased His Lordship with a knife.

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:20.280
You mean His Lordship?

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:25.720
-Then I'll steer well clear of her. -Wait for me!

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:32.160
Grand Tutor, this way.

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:35.480
As Lord Shen instructed,

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:37.320
We've arranged your rooms

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:38.880
In the eastern wing of the prefectural office.

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:40.800
I'll show you there now.

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:45.160
Which Lord Shen

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.520
Are you referring to?

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:47.600
That would be me.

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:50.720
Father.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:53.800
Your handsome, dashing,

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:55.480
Graceful and distinguished son,

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:56.440
Shen Zhishu.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.120
Zhishu!

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:01.760
My son has made something of himself.

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:04.240
Turn around. Let me have a good look.

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:07.160
So you're Lord Shen now, are you?

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:08.640
Have you lost your mind?

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:10.440
How dare you help His Majesty leave the palace?

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:11.480
You nearly buried

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:12.600
The lives of our entire Shen clan.

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:14.760
I was acting out of loyalty.

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:16.600
-I was easing His Majesty's worries. -You call that easing his worries?

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:18.280
The Shen family has upheld its good name for generations.

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:21.040
How did I end up with a reckless monkey like you?

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:21.960
Father!

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:22.880
-Still running? -Father!

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:24.080
I'm a court official now.

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:26.240
Assaulting an official is punishable by law.

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:28.960
I'll beat you to death, then apologize to the late emperor.

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:31.360
-Still running? -Father...

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:33.680
I order you to put down that weapon at once.

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.000
If you lose control and kill me,

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:36.760
There'll be no son to see you to your grave.

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:38.640
How dare you curse your own father?

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:40.160
So you've grown bold, have you?

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:41.240
Get back here!

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:43.520
Why are you hiding? You'll be the death of me! You...

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:45.720
Your Majesty.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:46.640
If you don't go out there now,

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:48.400
Lord Shen will be beaten to death.

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:49.720
What's the rush?

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:51.320
Such a heartwarming father-son scene.

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:53.880
I haven't seen one since I took the throne.

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:55.480
-You ungrateful wretch! -Father!

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:56.400
I really am...

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:57.840
-Still running? -Stop enjoying the show!

00:06:57.920 --> 00:06:59.680
If you don't come out, I'll be spilling blood here!

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:01.440
You dare call for help? I'll beat him too!

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:07.640
I, Shen Wuchen, pay my respects to Your Majesty.

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:09.360
Grand Tutor, you're as formidable as ever.

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:10.680
Not a single strike misses its mark.

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:12.200
Father, you dropped to your knees awfully fast.

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:14.000
Much smoother than when you were hitting me.

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:14.960
Please rise, Grand Tutor.

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:18.240
This trip outside the palace

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:19.440
Was entirely my own decision.

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:21.320
Zhishu had no choice but to obey.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:22.960
If you blame him,

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.280
Then the fault is mine.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:27.080
Since Your Majesty has spoken for him,

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:29.040
I'll spare him this once.

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:30.600
In the Shazhou case, Your Majesty

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:32.760
Used one move as cover for another.

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:34.480
You purged the illegal arms trade

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:37.600
And made a brilliant move against the Left Chancellor.

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:39.080
I can almost see

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:40.960
The late emperor's bearing in you.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.120
You flatter me, Grand Tutor.

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:45.240
I've observed the court in secret for some time.

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:47.160
The situation is deeply tense.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.040
Your Majesty has

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:51.360
Far too few people you can trust.

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:53.640
Building your own loyal faction cannot wait.

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:56.320
Pei Jinghe, Vice Minister of War,

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:57.880
Is virtuous, capable, and strategically gifted.

00:07:57.960 --> 00:07:59.920
He was ostracized

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.960
For opposing Liu Ren's autocratic ways.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:02.560
He still holds an empty title.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:05.920
Now is the time to put him to use.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.680
Though you are outside the court,

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:10.600
You see its affairs with perfect clarity.

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:12.120
The realm is a chessboard,

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:13.560
And the sovereign is the player.

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:14.960
Though I stand far from court,

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:17.200
I gladly serve as Your Majesty's piece

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:18.760
To secure Great Ning.

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:20.680
Of the Six Ministries,

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:22.160
The Left Chancellor already controls four.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.160
Every talented man selected through past civil examinations

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:28.520
Became the Left Chancellor's disciple.

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:31.360
My only option now is to find another path

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:33.920
Through the women's special examination,

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:35.240
Which he considers beneath his notice.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:39.920
Your Majesty,

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:42.520
I have one more thing to say.

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:45.720
Every new sovereign needs his own ministers.

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:48.680
The power of both chancellors grows by the day.

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:50.560
If they join forces,

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:51.840
Your Majesty may be unable to withstand them.

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:55.000
The Left Chancellor is at the height of his power,

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:56.840
Which has already angered the Right Chancellor.

00:08:56.920 --> 00:08:59.640
Your Majesty can use that division to your advantage.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.360
As for the art of imperial balance,

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:05.840
I'm sure I need say no more.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:15.000
Did this painting fail to earn first rank

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:17.160
Because the brushwork was lacking?

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.480
No.

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:20.880
It depicts only still objects and lacks vitality.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:24.000
Not so.

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:26.160
Zhili is here.

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:43.560
Teacher.

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:52.680
This painting depicts a late-spring dusk.

00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:54.280
Yet the flowers, trees,

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:55.960
Clouds and mist

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:57.760
Are painted too brightly and lavishly.

00:09:57.840 --> 00:09:59.560
It loses its sense of reality.

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:01.000
When a painting lacks truth,

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.240
Its spirit disperses.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.240
When a person lacks sincerity,

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:05.480
There is rot beneath the surface.

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:08.080
Zhili, sit.

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:11.840
As always, Zhili

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:13.200
Understands me best.

00:10:13.720 --> 00:10:15.440
Zhili is quick-witted,

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:17.240
And, rarer still, perceptive.

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:19.040
In this women's special examination,

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:20.440
With your learning,

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:21.640
Merely passing

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:24.560
Is nothing; taking first place is within reach.

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:27.880
When Teacher placed on the honor roll

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:29.280
And first entered the Ministry of Works,

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:31.800
Your "Treatise on Flood Control" shook the court.

00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:34.320
Once implemented, it ended the floods in Jiangnan

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:35.480
And relieved the people's suffering.

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:38.040
I wish to follow Teacher into government

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:39.400
And share your burdens.

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:42.120
But yesterday I heard my father say

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:44.360
The Left Chancellor strongly opposes the women's examination.

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:45.520
Even if women enter office,

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:46.840
They may not rise above the sixth rank.

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:48.080
I'm afraid

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:49.720
Even if we pass by luck,

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.160
We'll have little chance to prove ourselves.

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:56.200
Talent has no outward form

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:57.240
And no gender.

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:58.600
His Majesty defied all opposition

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:00.160
To restore the women's special examination.

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:02.360
His desire to recruit talent is clear.

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:04.520
Once you enter government,

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:05.920
As long as I am there,

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.560
I will ensure you receive support.

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:12.760
Teacher truly is a worthy chancellor,

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:14.080
Seeking the people's welfare,

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:15.360
Opening a path for those of humble birth,

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:16.760
And restoring women's rightful standing.

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:18.040
Such integrity

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:19.720
Is no less than the Left Chancellor's.

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:21.760
Yet he has roots spanning three reigns

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:23.760
And holds four ministries in his grasp.

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:26.360
I cannot help feeling wronged on Teacher's behalf.

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:28.480
Since when have I cared about power or rank?

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:30.000
I have served the throne faithfully all my life.

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.400
Even if His Majesty gave all six ministries

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:33.000
Entirely to the Left Chancellor,

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:34.960
I would bear no resentment.

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:37.800
It pains me only that His Majesty has just ascended the throne.

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:41.000
All know the virtue of the Left Chancellor at court,

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:43.520
Yet none know the wisdom of the emperor in the palace.

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:46.520
The world says a worthy chancellor is hard to find.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:48.800
Only Teacher truly deserves that title.

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:55.600
I will naturally assist His Majesty

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:56.720
In forging a new era.

00:11:57.720 --> 00:11:58.560
When that day comes,

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:00.040
Women too may stand openly and proudly

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:01.240
In the imperial court.

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:05.920
We will remember

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:07.600
Teacher's noble words.

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:14.360
Zhao Chunnuan.

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:15.280
Present.

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:19.440
Xie Yunxi.

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:20.360
Present.

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:23.400
Mengmeng, did you see that?

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:26.400
She brought an entire case of ink.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:29.960
Are you here to support me

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:31.160
Or just to watch the spectacle?

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:34.200
Of course I'm here to give my little Mengmeng courage.

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:35.480
Last night I dreamed

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:37.040
That you came first in the examination.

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:40.680
I woke up laughing.

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:41.600
Fuzhi.

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:43.880
Then I couldn't fall asleep again,

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:45.760
So I got up and made you apricot-skin cakes.

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:47.840
They're right here. When the time comes, you can...

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.240
I forgot them.

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.160
I'll eat them after the exam.

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:56.840
Meng Tinghui.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.000
Present.

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:01.200
Go home and wait for me.

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:02.840
I'll stay right here with you. I'm not going anywhere.

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.680
Don't worry. To me, you're the best.

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:06.760
There's no need to be nervous. This provincial exam is nothing.

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:07.760
You've got this.

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:08.960
Fuzhi.

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:10.240
Keep talking and I'll get dizzy.

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:11.160
Fine, I'll stop.

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:14.520
Meng Tinghui.

00:13:23.960 --> 00:13:25.080
Mengmeng!

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:40.680
The provincial examination begins.

00:14:57.480 --> 00:15:00.080
(Capital Region)

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:04.680
We've entered the capital region.

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:05.960
Your Majesty.

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:07.040
Return to the palace at once.

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:07.960
Yes.

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:10.960
Keep up.

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:28.880
Welcome back, Your Majesty.

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:30.880
I have been waiting here for some time.

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:32.040
Thank you, Right Chancellor.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:01.640
Today is the day His Majesty emerges from retreat.

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:03.080
It's already noon.

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:04.960
Why is there still no sign of him?

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.000
Strange.

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:07.640
Even the Right Chancellor isn't here.

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:08.640
Insolence!

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.400
Before Sacred Ancestor Hall,

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:18.760
How dare you make such a racket?

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:38.840
His Majesty completing his ritual retreat is a major occasion.

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:41.880
How can the Right Chancellor be late?

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:43.280
What disgraceful conduct.

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:46.200
The Left Chancellor is right.

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:54.680
The scouts clearly saw the imperial carriage return last night.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:56.320
Could it be...

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:21.360
His Majesty has completed his ritual retreat.

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:24.400
We pay our respects to Your Majesty.

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:27.400
May Your Majesty enjoy long life and good health.

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.880
Rise, ministers.

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:39.080
Left Chancellor, I see

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.600
More white at your temples.

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.600
During my ten-day seclusion,

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:45.960
You handled affairs of state.

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:48.840
Your service was truly arduous and meritorious.

00:17:49.480 --> 00:17:51.720
I merely fulfilled my duty.

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:54.400
Those petty administrative matters

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:58.040
Cannot compare with Your Majesty's retreat

00:17:58.120 --> 00:17:59.200
To contemplate the great principles of governance.

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.280
Do you know

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:03.720
What I was contemplating?

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:06.920
I have had the honor of serving three wise sovereigns.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.960
I have acquired

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.240
Some understanding of state affairs.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:13.000
I dare speculate

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:14.320
That Your Majesty entered retreat

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:18.840
To study the late emperor's principles of rule.

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:22.760
As expected of a veteran of three reigns.

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:25.240
You understand me perfectly.

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.440
Your Majesty,

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:32.080
An urgent dispatch has arrived.

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:33.320
Please review it.

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:50.960
This matter is grave.

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:53.200
Chief Steward You.

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:55.920
Escort the ministers to the main hall to wait.

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:58.080
The Right Chancellor and I will follow shortly.

00:18:58.160 --> 00:18:59.000
Yes.

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:29.760
Snoring in the main hall?

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:30.960
What disgraceful conduct.

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:34.080
It's nearly two in the morning.

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:35.680
We've had three rounds of tea.

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:37.600
When will His Majesty arrive?

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:38.520
My lords,

00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:40.160
Please be patient.

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:41.680
His Majesty will arrive shortly.

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:43.800
Left Chancellor.

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:45.800
His Majesty took pity on your age

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:47.640
And specially granted you an armchair.

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:21.520
Gu Qin.

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:24.040
What matter has kept His Majesty so long?

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:27.040
His Majesty arrives.

00:20:56.240 --> 00:20:57.400
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:21:27.480 --> 00:21:29.120
My ministers, you've worked

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:30.560
Late into the night on state affairs.

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:31.560
You have my thanks.

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:33.880
During my ten-day ritual retreat,

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:35.880
The Left Chancellor handled state affairs.

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:39.360
-I prepared a generous gift for him. -Present it.

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:55.080
What does Your Majesty mean by this?

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:56.320
Left Chancellor, are you aware

00:21:56.400 --> 00:21:58.280
That your favored disciple Ding Chong

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:01.800
Used a plaque in your own calligraphy as protection

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:03.960
While deceiving his superiors and subordinates in Shazhou,

00:22:04.040 --> 00:22:06.160
Preying on the people and abusing his power?

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:07.600
Your Majesty.

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:09.440
Ding Chong told me himself

00:22:09.520 --> 00:22:11.560
That the Left Chancellor protected him all these years.

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:13.920
Here is the evidence of his crimes.

00:22:16.440 --> 00:22:17.280
Absurd!

00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:20.280
Colluding with criminals? Trafficking arms?

00:22:21.120 --> 00:22:22.640
I knew nothing

00:22:22.720 --> 00:22:24.600
Of anything Ding Chong did.

00:22:24.680 --> 00:22:26.080
How could I have protected him?

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:27.680
Was the plaque at Ding's residence

00:22:27.760 --> 00:22:29.280
Not written by the Left Chancellor?

00:22:29.880 --> 00:22:31.120
Yet to my eyes,

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:33.080
This is unquestionably your handwriting.

00:22:39.600 --> 00:22:41.000
Your Majesty, please judge wisely.

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:43.400
The Left Chancellor's disciples serve throughout Great Ning.

00:22:43.480 --> 00:22:45.520
Corrupt officials may exploit his inscriptions.

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:48.760
That is not something he could have foreseen.

00:22:49.840 --> 00:22:51.560
Besides, Shazhou lies on the frontier.

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:53.000
The Left Chancellor governed in Your Majesty's stead,

00:22:53.080 --> 00:22:54.520
Laboring day and night for the realm.

00:22:54.600 --> 00:22:55.760
Ding Chong falsified his achievements.

00:22:55.840 --> 00:22:57.680
The Left Chancellor could hardly control that.

00:22:59.840 --> 00:23:00.960
Your Majesty,

00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:02.040
I oversee the Ministry of War.

00:23:02.120 --> 00:23:04.240
A treacherous man like Ding Chong found a loophole

00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:05.720
Because I failed to investigate.

00:23:05.800 --> 00:23:07.520
The fault is mine

00:23:07.600 --> 00:23:08.640
And has nothing to do with the Left Chancellor.

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:11.400
I asked only one question,

00:23:11.480 --> 00:23:14.280
Yet each of you rushes to defend him.

00:23:14.360 --> 00:23:16.000
Am I wrong,

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:18.800
-or is the Left Chancellor beyond question? -Your Majesty.

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:21.120
I have served through three reigns.

00:23:21.200 --> 00:23:23.080
Heaven and earth can attest to my loyalty to Great Ning.

00:23:23.760 --> 00:23:25.280
Even this leg

00:23:25.360 --> 00:23:27.040
Was injured while protecting the late emperor

00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:28.840
From bandits of Zhongwan.

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:30.200
The wound left me permanently lame.

00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:33.320
My unwavering loyalty

00:23:33.400 --> 00:23:34.640
And countless achievements

00:23:34.720 --> 00:23:36.120
Are why every official respects me.

00:23:36.200 --> 00:23:39.160
But when Your Majesty went to Shazhou,

00:23:39.240 --> 00:23:41.160
Who clouded your judgment?

00:23:41.240 --> 00:23:43.440
What slander from petty villains did you hear

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:46.680
To make you so suspicious and dissatisfied with me?

00:23:46.760 --> 00:23:49.400
Left Chancellor, perhaps age has confused you.

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:51.120
For the past ten days,

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:53.400
I remained in seclusion at Sacred Ancestor Hall,

00:23:53.480 --> 00:23:54.800
Studying the art of governance.

00:23:54.880 --> 00:23:56.880
When did I ever go to Shazhou?

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:01.520
It seems Your Majesty's visit to that savage land

00:24:01.600 --> 00:24:03.960
Taught you quite a few

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:05.760
Shameless tricks.

00:24:05.840 --> 00:24:07.360
Now I remember.

00:24:07.440 --> 00:24:10.040
I did visit Shazhou ten years ago.

00:24:10.120 --> 00:24:13.120
Have you confused this with an old memory?

00:24:13.200 --> 00:24:14.440
I have a witness.

00:24:14.520 --> 00:24:16.240
-Where is this witness? -Shen Zhishu.

00:24:16.320 --> 00:24:17.480
Minister Shen?

00:24:17.560 --> 00:24:18.760
You went to Shazhou?

00:24:18.840 --> 00:24:19.720
Your Majesty,

00:24:20.440 --> 00:24:21.360
I did.

00:24:22.840 --> 00:24:25.080
At Your Majesty's command, I inspected Shazhou

00:24:25.160 --> 00:24:26.520
And witnessed its chaos firsthand.

00:24:26.600 --> 00:24:28.880
I brought back evidence against Ding Chong and the others.

00:24:28.960 --> 00:24:30.360
How dare you, Shen Zhishu!

00:24:30.440 --> 00:24:32.760
That night in Sacred Ancestor Hall, you posed as His Majesty.

00:24:32.840 --> 00:24:35.440
I was the one who ordered you to Shazhou to bring him back.

00:24:35.520 --> 00:24:37.080
Mind your words, Left Chancellor.

00:24:37.160 --> 00:24:39.200
Trespassing in Sacred Ancestor Hall is a grave crime.

00:24:39.280 --> 00:24:41.520
Don't drag Shen Zhishu into this

00:24:41.600 --> 00:24:42.920
And add another charge to your own record

00:24:43.000 --> 00:24:44.720
Merely to frame me.

00:24:44.800 --> 00:24:45.640
Please calm your anger, Your Majesty.

00:24:45.720 --> 00:24:47.840
The Left Chancellor is advanced in years.

00:24:47.920 --> 00:24:50.000
It's only natural that he misremember some things.

00:24:54.560 --> 00:24:56.480
So this entire journey

00:24:56.560 --> 00:24:59.640
Was a trap laid specifically for me.

00:24:59.720 --> 00:25:02.200
-That is not so, Left Chancellor. -Your Majesty.

00:25:02.280 --> 00:25:04.640
After a long investigation, I have obtained conclusive evidence.

00:25:04.720 --> 00:25:06.160
Wang Qi, Military Governor of Shazhou,

00:25:06.240 --> 00:25:07.600
Violated military regulations

00:25:07.680 --> 00:25:09.360
And bypassed General Gao Meng

00:25:09.440 --> 00:25:11.400
To collude with Minister of War Liu Ren.

00:25:11.480 --> 00:25:12.920
Together they embezzled 300,000 taels in military funds.

00:25:13.000 --> 00:25:15.440
Wang Qi and Gao Meng await outside the hall.

00:25:15.520 --> 00:25:18.200
They can confront Minister Liu here and establish the truth.

00:25:18.280 --> 00:25:19.320
Summon them.

00:25:19.400 --> 00:25:20.240
Summon them.

00:25:23.560 --> 00:25:26.000
Your Majesty, I confess my guilt.

00:25:28.520 --> 00:25:29.640
Your Majesty.

00:25:30.360 --> 00:25:31.640
I was foolish for a moment.

00:25:31.720 --> 00:25:32.720
I deserve ten thousand deaths.

00:25:32.800 --> 00:25:35.000
I beg Your Majesty for mercy!

00:25:35.080 --> 00:25:36.400
Mercy!

00:25:37.560 --> 00:25:39.080
Left Chancellor.

00:25:39.160 --> 00:25:40.440
Liu Ren held a vital office,

00:25:40.520 --> 00:25:42.200
Yet colluded with a frontier general,

00:25:42.280 --> 00:25:45.200
Accepted bribes, violated the law, and compromised military affairs.

00:25:45.280 --> 00:25:47.600
The witnesses and evidence are conclusive.

00:25:47.680 --> 00:25:49.240
What punishment does the law prescribe?

00:25:49.320 --> 00:25:50.600
Your Majesty,

00:25:51.160 --> 00:25:52.680
Under the Code of Great Ning,

00:25:52.760 --> 00:25:53.840
He should receive one hundred strokes,

00:25:53.920 --> 00:25:56.080
Be dismissed and investigated, with his property confiscated.

00:25:56.160 --> 00:25:57.880
But considering Liu Ren's many years of service...

00:25:57.960 --> 00:25:58.840
Granted.

00:25:59.800 --> 00:26:01.920
We'll proceed exactly as the Left Chancellor suggests.

00:26:02.000 --> 00:26:04.080
Dismiss Liu Ren and investigate him at once.

00:26:04.160 --> 00:26:06.320
Wang Qi, as Military Governor, trafficked arms

00:26:06.400 --> 00:26:09.400
And bribed court officials. He is sentenced to immediate execution.

00:26:09.480 --> 00:26:11.720
General Gao Meng was not the principal offender,

00:26:11.800 --> 00:26:14.200
But failed in his supervisory duty.

00:26:14.280 --> 00:26:15.800
Demote him by one rank.

00:26:15.880 --> 00:26:17.320
Keep him in the army to redeem himself through service.

00:26:17.400 --> 00:26:20.400
Every military and Ministry of War official implicated

00:26:20.480 --> 00:26:22.360
Must be investigated to the end.

00:26:22.440 --> 00:26:24.280
No one will be spared.

00:26:38.000 --> 00:26:38.840
Your Majesty.

00:26:38.920 --> 00:26:40.160
The post of Minister of War

00:26:40.240 --> 00:26:42.360
Is vital to national security and cannot remain vacant.

00:26:42.440 --> 00:26:44.520
I recommend Pei Jinghe, Vice Minister of War.

00:26:44.600 --> 00:26:46.560
He passed the civil examinations and is exceptionally talented.

00:26:46.640 --> 00:26:48.840
He opposed Liu Ren's autocratic conduct,

00:26:48.920 --> 00:26:50.400
And was ostracized for it,

00:26:50.480 --> 00:26:52.600
Then exiled to the nominal post of Military Supervisor.

00:26:52.680 --> 00:26:53.560
He has been left idle ever since.

00:26:53.640 --> 00:26:54.840
Draft the edict at once.

00:26:54.920 --> 00:26:56.240
Recall him to the capital

00:26:56.320 --> 00:26:58.360
To serve as acting Minister of War.

00:26:58.440 --> 00:27:01.640
Your Majesty, the Minister of War bears grave responsibility.

00:27:01.720 --> 00:27:03.520
Such a hasty appointment

00:27:03.600 --> 00:27:05.000
May be unwise.

00:27:05.080 --> 00:27:07.320
Then the Right Chancellor will supervise him personally.

00:27:07.400 --> 00:27:09.720
They will share both reward and punishment.

00:27:09.800 --> 00:27:12.080
I will work with him wholeheartedly

00:27:12.160 --> 00:27:13.560
And not fail Your Majesty's trust.

00:27:13.640 --> 00:27:14.920
Good.

00:27:19.400 --> 00:27:21.160
Then it is settled.

00:27:21.240 --> 00:27:22.760
My ministers,

00:27:22.840 --> 00:27:25.200
You should exercise more often.

00:27:25.840 --> 00:27:28.120
After all, there will be

00:27:29.200 --> 00:27:30.400
Many more late-night court sessions like this.

00:27:31.080 --> 00:27:31.960
Your Majesty...

00:27:32.040 --> 00:27:34.840
-We respectfully see Your Majesty off. -We respectfully see Your Majesty off.

00:27:43.880 --> 00:27:46.800
To celebrate her friend Meng Tinghui becoming Provincial Laureate,

00:27:46.880 --> 00:27:48.280
Manager Yan will serve free porridge for three days.

00:27:53.880 --> 00:27:55.920
There's enough for everyone. Don't rush.

00:27:57.920 --> 00:27:59.040
Here.

00:27:59.120 --> 00:28:00.120
Slowly.

00:28:00.680 --> 00:28:02.320
Don't rush. Everyone will get some.

00:28:04.400 --> 00:28:05.240
The weather is cold.

00:28:05.320 --> 00:28:07.360
Manager Yan specially prepared some cold medicine

00:28:07.440 --> 00:28:09.440
To protect everyone from the chill.

00:28:09.520 --> 00:28:10.800
Here. Hold it carefully.

00:28:10.880 --> 00:28:11.960
What a generous soul. Thank you.

00:28:17.440 --> 00:28:18.360
Father!

00:28:20.760 --> 00:28:21.640
Careful.

00:28:21.720 --> 00:28:23.320
It was Meng Tinghui who became Provincial Laureate,

00:28:23.400 --> 00:28:24.240
Not you.

00:28:24.320 --> 00:28:26.120
Yet you still have the nerve to make a spectacle for her.

00:28:26.200 --> 00:28:27.080
How embarrassing.

00:28:27.160 --> 00:28:29.520
I'm ashamed for you. Come home with me.

00:28:31.400 --> 00:28:33.040
Bofeng House is profitable now.

00:28:33.120 --> 00:28:34.240
I can do as I please.

00:28:34.320 --> 00:28:36.200
At the start of spring, I'll accompany Mengmeng to the metropolitan exam

00:28:36.280 --> 00:28:37.840
And open new trade routes in the capital.

00:28:37.920 --> 00:28:39.560
You're going with her to the capital?

00:28:41.040 --> 00:28:43.200
She has you completely bewitched.

00:28:43.280 --> 00:28:45.440
I raised you for nothing.

00:28:45.520 --> 00:28:46.560
Husband.

00:28:47.800 --> 00:28:49.680
Fuzhi may be a daughter,

00:28:49.760 --> 00:28:51.480
But she has thoughts of her own.

00:28:51.560 --> 00:28:53.480
Don't listen to those gossiping old women

00:28:53.560 --> 00:28:55.880
Who say a woman in public can't find a husband.

00:28:55.960 --> 00:28:57.920
Even if Fuzhi never marries,

00:28:58.000 --> 00:28:59.360
We can afford to support her.

00:28:59.440 --> 00:29:01.160
Never marry?

00:29:01.240 --> 00:29:02.560
Is she going to spend her whole life

00:29:02.640 --> 00:29:04.560
Fooling around with Meng Tinghui?

00:29:04.640 --> 00:29:06.680
Marriages are decided by parents and matchmakers.

00:29:06.760 --> 00:29:08.880
She'll marry whoever I choose.

00:29:08.960 --> 00:29:10.240
Fuzhi.

00:29:11.160 --> 00:29:12.080
About your marriage,

00:29:12.160 --> 00:29:13.720
I'll speak properly with your father.

00:29:15.600 --> 00:29:16.880
Stop fighting with him.

00:29:20.680 --> 00:29:21.520
Madam!

00:29:22.720 --> 00:29:23.560
Madam!

00:29:26.920 --> 00:29:28.400
-Husband. -Madam!

00:29:28.480 --> 00:29:29.320
Are you all right?

00:29:29.400 --> 00:29:31.440
I fell by myself.

00:29:31.520 --> 00:29:32.400
Don't blame Fuzhi.

00:29:32.480 --> 00:29:34.480
After all these years, your tricks of framing people

00:29:34.560 --> 00:29:35.680
Haven't changed one bit.

00:29:35.760 --> 00:29:36.840
You...

00:29:38.960 --> 00:29:39.800
Mengmeng!

00:29:39.880 --> 00:29:41.360
Meng Tinghui!

00:29:41.440 --> 00:29:43.040
How dare you stop me?

00:29:43.120 --> 00:29:44.080
-You dare... -I...

00:29:44.920 --> 00:29:46.000
I'm already the Provincial Laureate.

00:29:46.080 --> 00:29:47.600
Even before the governor, I need not bow.

00:29:47.680 --> 00:29:49.160
If you slap me,

00:29:49.240 --> 00:29:50.640
Aren't you afraid all Shazhou will say

00:29:50.720 --> 00:29:52.120
You struck the court-recognized Provincial Laureate in public?

00:29:52.680 --> 00:29:53.760
I...

00:29:53.840 --> 00:29:55.520
I may not control you,

00:29:55.600 --> 00:29:57.440
But I can control my own daughter.

00:29:57.520 --> 00:29:58.800
Guards!

00:29:58.880 --> 00:29:59.920
Take her home.

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:01.120
-Mengmeng! -Wait.

00:30:02.400 --> 00:30:05.120
I have informed the Imperial Inspector overseeing Shazhou

00:30:05.200 --> 00:30:06.960
That Master Yan, in his public-minded generosity,

00:30:07.040 --> 00:30:08.400
Will celebrate the provincial exam results

00:30:08.480 --> 00:30:10.080
By serving free porridge for three days

00:30:10.160 --> 00:30:11.520
And has graciously allowed his daughter

00:30:11.600 --> 00:30:12.920
To accompany me to the capital.

00:30:13.480 --> 00:30:14.840
Utter nonsense!

00:30:25.760 --> 00:30:27.200
By order of the Imperial Inspector,

00:30:27.280 --> 00:30:29.880
We congratulate Provincial Laureate Meng on taking first place.

00:30:29.960 --> 00:30:31.120
Student Meng Tinghui

00:30:31.200 --> 00:30:32.120
Thanks the Imperial Inspector.

00:30:32.200 --> 00:30:34.240
The Inspector presents the Yan family

00:30:34.320 --> 00:30:35.600
With a ceremonial silk banner honoring their household,

00:30:35.680 --> 00:30:37.960
In recognition of Master Yan and his daughter's generosity.

00:30:42.760 --> 00:30:44.400
Thank you for the honor.

00:30:44.480 --> 00:30:46.680
Thank you...

00:30:46.760 --> 00:30:47.720
Meng Tinghui.

00:30:48.600 --> 00:30:49.720
You win.

00:30:49.800 --> 00:30:51.520
Thank you, Madam Yan.

00:30:52.240 --> 00:30:53.680
Please tell the Imperial Inspector

00:30:53.760 --> 00:30:54.880
That Madam Yan just said

00:30:54.960 --> 00:30:57.080
She would copy the Sutra of Immeasurable Life one thousand...

00:30:57.160 --> 00:30:58.000
Ten thousand times.

00:30:58.080 --> 00:31:00.200
Ten thousand copies of the Sutra of Immeasurable Life

00:31:00.280 --> 00:31:02.600
To pray for our safe journey to the capital.

00:31:03.360 --> 00:31:04.200
You're lying!

00:31:18.080 --> 00:31:19.280
Thank you, Master Yan.

00:31:26.040 --> 00:31:28.120
Thank you! Thank you, generous sir!

00:31:28.200 --> 00:31:29.760
Mengmeng, I'm so lucky.

00:31:29.840 --> 00:31:31.800
Now I can go to the capital with you.

00:31:32.920 --> 00:31:33.760
That banner honoring the family

00:31:33.840 --> 00:31:36.040
Was something I asked the Inspector to send in advance.

00:31:36.120 --> 00:31:38.960
I knew your father and stepmother would try to stop us.

00:31:40.280 --> 00:31:42.040
Mengmeng, you're so good to me.

00:31:42.120 --> 00:31:44.760
Meeting you is the greatest blessing of my life.

00:31:46.400 --> 00:31:47.400
Everyone's watching.

00:31:55.280 --> 00:31:56.560
Sister Ah Xiang.

00:31:57.480 --> 00:31:59.920
I brought your favorite apricot-skin cakes.

00:32:03.040 --> 00:32:04.200
I miss you so much.

00:32:06.000 --> 00:32:08.040
I miss how you held me in the cage

00:32:08.680 --> 00:32:10.080
While we kept each other warm.

00:32:12.600 --> 00:32:14.320
I miss you playing the flute for me

00:32:15.360 --> 00:32:16.600
And teaching me

00:32:16.680 --> 00:32:18.640
Your favorite song.

00:32:21.280 --> 00:32:23.600
That place was unbearable,

00:32:24.680 --> 00:32:25.640
But as long as you were there,

00:32:27.200 --> 00:32:28.880
You were my home.

00:32:32.040 --> 00:32:33.560
Sister Ah Xiang.

00:32:35.080 --> 00:32:36.840
I hate that I was so weak.

00:32:39.120 --> 00:32:41.800
I hate that I couldn't protect you then.

00:32:49.800 --> 00:32:50.880
Tinghui.

00:32:52.200 --> 00:32:54.000
You must escape from here.

00:32:55.400 --> 00:32:56.680
Go as far away as you can.

00:32:57.440 --> 00:32:58.480
Sister Ah Xiang.

00:32:59.480 --> 00:33:00.560
Hold on.

00:33:01.240 --> 00:33:03.280
We can escape.

00:33:03.360 --> 00:33:05.040
We can survive.

00:33:40.040 --> 00:33:41.000
Sister Ah Xiang!

00:33:43.200 --> 00:33:44.160
Sister Ah Xiang!

00:33:46.760 --> 00:33:47.960
Sister Ah Xiang!

00:33:50.120 --> 00:33:51.360
Sister Ah Xiang!

00:33:52.760 --> 00:33:54.880
Sister Ah Xiang, say something!

00:33:54.960 --> 00:33:56.160
Sister Ah Xiang!

00:33:58.360 --> 00:34:01.240
What's wrong? Don't scare me!

00:34:02.120 --> 00:34:03.560
Sister Ah Xiang!

00:34:10.040 --> 00:34:12.040
Hold on, Sister Ah Xiang!

00:34:44.320 --> 00:34:46.000
You little bitch!

00:35:01.360 --> 00:35:02.840
You dare touch me?

00:35:03.640 --> 00:35:05.040
You'll both die!

00:35:07.560 --> 00:35:08.600
Finish her.

00:36:09.240 --> 00:36:10.280
Sister Ah Xiang!

00:36:11.880 --> 00:36:13.200
Shazhou today

00:36:14.320 --> 00:36:16.520
Is nothing like it was back then.

00:36:17.880 --> 00:36:18.880
Those evil men

00:36:19.600 --> 00:36:21.280
Finally received their punishment.

00:36:26.520 --> 00:36:27.680
Sister,

00:36:29.400 --> 00:36:30.920
I never forgot

00:36:32.120 --> 00:36:33.440
The promise we made.

00:36:39.560 --> 00:36:40.400
Look.

00:36:41.960 --> 00:36:43.240
I attended the women's academy,

00:36:44.240 --> 00:36:45.360
Became Provincial Laureate,

00:36:46.120 --> 00:36:48.440
And will soon go to the capital for the metropolitan exam.

00:36:50.200 --> 00:36:52.680
They say the capital's palace walls are high

00:36:52.760 --> 00:36:54.320
And its halls vast.

00:36:54.400 --> 00:36:56.080
But there must be a place

00:36:57.400 --> 00:36:59.520
Where our shared dream can belong.

00:37:08.920 --> 00:37:11.640
I will stand in the highest halls of power.

00:37:13.400 --> 00:37:15.400
I will make myself strong.

00:37:19.280 --> 00:37:20.840
I will protect Fuzhi.

00:37:23.360 --> 00:37:25.560
I will protect everyone close to me.

00:37:28.840 --> 00:37:30.120
I will make this a world

00:37:31.240 --> 00:37:34.080
Where no one can trample on another person's life.

00:37:38.520 --> 00:37:41.720
People like you and me

00:37:44.800 --> 00:37:47.000
Will all stand in this light.

00:37:50.600 --> 00:37:51.600
Tinghui.

00:37:52.920 --> 00:37:54.800
Walk toward the light.

00:37:56.560 --> 00:37:58.720
You must live.

00:38:10.040 --> 00:38:11.000
Sister.

00:38:11.800 --> 00:38:12.960
Once I leave for the capital,

00:38:13.720 --> 00:38:15.840
I may not be able to visit for a long time.

00:38:16.720 --> 00:38:17.920
If you miss me,

00:38:19.360 --> 00:38:21.480
Will you visit my dreams?

00:38:34.120 --> 00:38:36.120
I heard the capital is terribly damp.

00:38:36.200 --> 00:38:38.040
I brought you a rhino-horn pillow to keep away the moisture.

00:38:38.880 --> 00:38:39.880
Fuzhi.

00:38:39.960 --> 00:38:41.960
Are you accompanying me to the exam or moving house?

00:38:42.040 --> 00:38:43.040
Mengmeng.

00:38:43.120 --> 00:38:45.040
We don't know anyone in the capital.

00:38:45.120 --> 00:38:47.760
Of course I must make sure you're comfortable in every way.

00:38:47.840 --> 00:38:48.680
Provincial Laureate Meng.

00:38:48.760 --> 00:38:50.400
Everything is packed. We can leave.

00:38:50.480 --> 00:38:52.040
With all this ostentation,

00:38:52.120 --> 00:38:53.960
Aren't you afraid bandits will rob us on the road?

00:38:54.040 --> 00:38:55.640
We have our own royal safeguard.

00:38:56.720 --> 00:38:58.440
Only bandits with a death wish

00:38:58.520 --> 00:39:00.520
Would rob a Provincial Laureate headed for the capital exam.

00:39:00.600 --> 00:39:02.600
I want my dearest, dearest Mengmeng

00:39:02.680 --> 00:39:04.360
To leave Shazhou in grand style.

00:39:04.440 --> 00:39:06.560
-But the journey is long... -Don't worry.

00:39:06.640 --> 00:39:07.680
Every prefecture along the way

00:39:07.760 --> 00:39:09.680
Will surely extend every courtesy to Provincial Laureate Meng.

00:39:09.760 --> 00:39:11.440
The journey will be smooth sailing.

00:39:15.440 --> 00:39:17.560
Capital, here we come!

00:39:17.640 --> 00:39:20.440
Here we come!

00:39:28.480 --> 00:39:29.480
Come back safely.

00:39:46.440 --> 00:39:47.280
Your Majesty.

00:39:48.280 --> 00:39:50.000
The east wind you've been waiting for has arrived.

00:39:51.000 --> 00:39:52.240
The east wind?

00:39:54.240 --> 00:39:55.520
Aren't these lists of successful candidates from every province

00:39:55.600 --> 00:39:57.720
The east wind Your Majesty needs to break the Left Chancellor's hold?

00:40:01.320 --> 00:40:02.240
Not bad.

00:40:02.320 --> 00:40:04.520
Shen Zhili ranked first in the capital.

00:40:05.600 --> 00:40:06.720
The blood of our Shen family.

00:40:06.800 --> 00:40:07.640
Naturally.

00:40:07.720 --> 00:40:10.360
You inherited your post; she passed the exam. You dare compare?

00:40:11.000 --> 00:40:11.840
Exactly.

00:40:13.080 --> 00:40:14.280
Someone shut him up.

00:40:20.400 --> 00:40:21.480
Meng Tinghui.

00:40:22.920 --> 00:40:24.760
She ranked first in Shazhou.

00:40:24.840 --> 00:40:26.040
Could she be

00:40:26.120 --> 00:40:27.480
The Miss Meng who helped Your Majesty

00:40:27.560 --> 00:40:28.800
Solve the case in Shazhou?

00:40:28.880 --> 00:40:30.480
A talent as sturdy as pine

00:40:30.560 --> 00:40:31.840
Should be tested in the fiercest wind.

00:40:31.920 --> 00:40:34.040
The Left Chancellor's disciples fill all six ministries.

00:40:34.120 --> 00:40:35.840
This women's special examination

00:40:35.920 --> 00:40:38.640
Is Heaven's gift for me to promote useful talent.

00:40:38.720 --> 00:40:41.120
This time, I'll knock that old fossil flat on his back.

00:40:43.360 --> 00:40:44.840
The wind is rising.

00:40:44.920 --> 00:40:47.400
Let's see how she rides it straight into the clouds.

00:40:57.720 --> 00:41:00.240
Shops in the capital really are livelier than Shazhou's.

00:41:00.320 --> 00:41:02.640
We'll have to look around properly later.

00:41:02.720 --> 00:41:04.240
I had long heard of the capital's splendor.

00:41:04.320 --> 00:41:06.480
Now I see the books captured barely a tenth of it.

00:41:07.320 --> 00:41:08.320
Fuzhi.

00:41:08.400 --> 00:41:09.520
I hear Huiyin Music House

00:41:09.600 --> 00:41:11.040
Is on Changle Street,

00:41:11.120 --> 00:41:12.520
And Situ Xue is its proprietor.

00:41:12.600 --> 00:41:13.600
How do you know?

00:41:14.560 --> 00:41:17.320
How could I impersonate her without doing my homework?

00:41:21.080 --> 00:41:22.280
The capital.

00:41:22.360 --> 00:41:23.400
We really made it.

00:41:24.080 --> 00:41:25.800
I'm Yan Fuzhi.

00:41:25.880 --> 00:41:27.680
She's Meng Tinghui.

00:41:27.760 --> 00:41:30.720
Capital, here we come!

00:41:32.120 --> 00:41:33.120
So many people.

00:41:41.200 --> 00:41:42.440
Welcome! Welcome!

00:41:42.520 --> 00:41:44.040
A very warm welcome!

00:41:44.120 --> 00:41:45.480
Welcome! Welcome!

00:41:45.560 --> 00:41:46.800
A very warm welcome!

00:41:46.880 --> 00:41:48.240
Welcome! Welcome!

00:41:48.320 --> 00:41:49.360
A very warm welcome!

00:41:49.440 --> 00:41:50.760
Enough.

00:41:51.960 --> 00:41:54.160
Welcome, honored provincial graduates!

00:41:54.240 --> 00:41:55.120
Shunzi.

00:41:56.920 --> 00:41:57.760
Scholars who cross our threshold

00:41:57.840 --> 00:41:59.200
Are bound to make the honor roll.

00:42:03.400 --> 00:42:04.920
Look closely, Manager.

00:42:05.000 --> 00:42:07.240
This is Shazhou's Provincial Laureate.

00:42:07.320 --> 00:42:09.000
The Provincial Laureate graces us!

00:42:09.080 --> 00:42:11.480
Chunman Inn is truly honored by your presence.

00:42:11.560 --> 00:42:12.480
All our guests

00:42:12.560 --> 00:42:14.600
Are female scholars from across the realm here for the metropolitan exam.

00:42:14.680 --> 00:42:15.680
As for the best rooms,

00:42:15.760 --> 00:42:17.520
Only one remains.

00:42:18.320 --> 00:42:20.200
Shunzi, show our honored guests in.

00:42:20.760 --> 00:42:21.880
This way.

00:42:23.920 --> 00:42:26.960
When you pass, don't forget me, Yu Manchun.

00:42:27.040 --> 00:42:27.920
Easy, easy.

00:43:08.440 --> 00:43:10.480
To the Tiger's Roar Gang!

00:43:11.320 --> 00:43:13.360
To our Chief!

00:43:22.720 --> 00:43:24.640
The tiger's roar shakes the sky!

00:43:24.720 --> 00:43:27.000
Brothers united strike it rich!

00:43:30.840 --> 00:43:31.680
Chief.

00:43:32.440 --> 00:43:33.400
The goods have arrived.

00:43:34.924 --> 00:43:36.924
MkvDrama.Net

